## Common Gotchas
1. Always mock `isApproved()` before calling URL-related methods
2. Remember to test both approved and pending message variants
3. Ensure proper cleanup in tearDown() if needed
4. Mock all required model relationships
5. Test notification preferences if applicable
6. Verify proper event dispatching
7. Test channel-specific formatting
8. Use `createMockNotifiable()` from base TestCase instead of implementing your own
